OL,4,CBurnham's Brexit reset deal at risk    
OL,5,Cunless UK cuts European student fees,  
OL,6,CEU officials say                       
OL,7,GPrime Minister Andy Burnham is in      
OL,8,GBrussels where he's trying to secure a 
OL,9,Gnew UK-EU deal, covering issues such   
OL,10,Gas youth mobility, food exports,       
OL,11,Gcarbon emissions and migration.        
OL,13,FBut EU officials say the deal won't    
OL,14,Fhappen unless the prime minister       
OL,15,Fagrees to cut university tuition fees  
OL,16,Ffor European students.                 
OL,18,FThe youth mobility scheme is expected  
OL,19,Fto allow 100,000 young people from the 
OL,20,FEU to travel, work and study in the UK 
OL,21,Fper year - the same number of young    
OL,22,FBritons would be allowed into Europe.  
